---
import { getRelativeLocaleUrl } from "astro:i18n";
import Icon from "./Icon.astro";
import { translator, type Locale } from "../lib/i18n";
interface Props {
  locale: Locale;
}
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const t = translator(locale);
const comparisonJpyPerUsd = 150;
const exampleUsdPerMinute = 1 / comparisonJpyPerUsd;
const githubMacosUsdPerMinute = 0.062;
const savingsPercent = Math.round(
  (1 - exampleUsdPerMinute / githubMacosUsdPerMinute) * 100,
);
---

<section
  id="pricing"
  class="section wrap pricing"
  aria-labelledby="pricing-title"
>
  <div class="section-label">
    <span class="section-number">03</span>
    <span>PRICING</span>
  </div>
  <div class="section-heading">
    <h2 id="pricing-title">
      {t("使った分だけ、", "Simple pricing.")}
      <br />
      {t("シンプルな料金。", "By the minute.")}
    </h2>
    <p>
      {t(
        "Apple Siliconで動くGenuineCI Cloud。CIの実行時間に応じて、1分1円（税込）で利用できます。",
        "GenuineCI Cloud runs on Apple Silicon. CI runtime costs ¥1 per minute, tax included.",
      )}
    </p>
  </div>
  <article class="pricing-card" aria-labelledby="plan-cloud">
    <div>
      <h3 id="plan-cloud">GenuineCI Cloud</h3>
      <p class="pricing-description">
        {t(
          "個人開発からチーム開発まで、必要な分だけ。",
          "For solo developers and teams. Use the build time you need.",
        )}
      </p>
      <p class="pricing-price">
        <span class="pricing-currency">¥</span>
        <strong>1</strong>
        <span class="pricing-period">{t("/ 分", "/ min")}</span>
      </p>
      <p class="pricing-example">
        {t(
          "10分なら10円、100分なら100円。",
          "10 minutes cost ¥10 and 100 minutes cost ¥100.",
        )}
      </p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="pricing-savings">
        {t(
          `1ドル＝${comparisonJpyPerUsd}円の換算例では、GitHub ActionsのmacOSより、`,
          `At an illustrative ¥${comparisonJpyPerUsd} per US dollar, about `,
        )}
        <span class="pricing-savings-amount">
          {t(`分単価が約${savingsPercent}%安い。`, `${savingsPercent}% less`)}
        </span>
        {t("", " per macOS minute than GitHub Actions.")}
      </p>
      <table class="pricing-comparison">
        <caption>
          {t(
            `macOSの有料実行・1分あたり（1ドル＝${comparisonJpyPerUsd}円の換算例）`,
            `Paid macOS runtime per minute (USD example at ¥${comparisonJpyPerUsd} per dollar)`,
          )}
        </caption>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">GenuineCI Cloud</th>
            <td>US${exampleUsdPerMinute.toFixed(4)}</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">GitHub Actions macOS</th>
            <td>US${githubMacosUsdPerMinute.toFixed(3)}</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <ul class="check-list pricing-features">
        <li>
          <Icon name="check" marketing />
          {t("Apple SiliconのMacで実行", "Run on Apple Silicon Macs")}
        </li>
        <li>
          <Icon name="check" marketing />
          {t("チーム全員で利用可能", "Available to your whole team")}
        </li>
        <li>
          <Icon name="check" marketing />
          {t("チーム単位の同時実行数制限なし", "No per-team concurrency limit")}
        </li>
      </ul>
      <a
        class="button button-dark"
        href="https://dashboard.openci.org/"
        aria-label={t(
          "GenuineCI Cloudのダッシュボードを開く",
          "Open the GenuineCI Cloud dashboard",
        )}
      >
        <span>{t("ダッシュボードを開く", "Open dashboard")}</span>
        <Icon name="external" marketing />
      </a>
    </div>
  </article>
  <p class="pricing-comparison-note">
    {t(
      "GitHub-hosted標準macOSランナーの有料分単価と比較。無料利用・割引を除く。2026-11-08確認。",
      "Compared with paid per-minute rates for standard GitHub-hosted macOS runners. Free usage and discounts excluded. Checked 2026-11-08.",
    )}{" "}
    <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/billing/reference/actions-runner-pricing">
      {t("GitHub公式料金", "GitHub pricing")}
    </a>
  </p>
  <p class="pricing-comparison-note">
    {t(
      "※「世界最安」は、当社が公開料金を確認した下記3サービスとのmacOS分単価比較によるものです（2026-11-08時点、1ドル＝150円の換算例）。無料利用・割引・定額契約を除きます。",
      '*"World\'s lowest-priced" refers to macOS per-minute rates among the three providers whose public pricing we compared, as of 2026-11-08, using the illustrative rate of ¥150 per US dollar. Free usage, discounts and fixed-price plans are excluded.',
    )}{" "}
    <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/billing/reference/actions-runner-pricing">
      GitHub Actions
    </a>
    {" / "}
    <a href="https://codemagic.io/pricing/">Codemagic</a>
    {" / "}
    <a href="https://namespace.so/pricing">Namespace</a>
  </p>
  <p class="pricing-signup">
    {t(
      "料金・お支払いの設定は、Webダッシュボードでチームを選び、「設定 → 課金を管理」から確認できます。",
      "To review your billing settings, select your team in the web dashboard, then open Settings → Manage billing.",
    )}
  </p>
  <ul class="pricing-notes">
    <li>
      {t(
        "USDでのお支払いは、月の円建て合計を月締め時に記録した為替レートで換算します。",
        "For USD invoices, we convert the monthly yen total at the exchange rate recorded when the billing month closes.",
      )}
    </li>
    <li>
      {t(
        "VM準備完了後の実行時間をチームごとに月単位で合計し、最後に1分単位に切り上げます。",
        "Each month we total your team’s runtime after VM preparation and round up once to the next whole minute.",
      )}
    </li>
    <li>
      {t(
        "チーム単位の同時実行数制限はありません。実際の開始時刻は、ワーカーの空き状況によります。",
        "There is no concurrency cap per team. When jobs start depends on worker availability.",
      )}
    </li>
  </ul>
  <div class="pricing-self-hosted">
    <p>
      {t(
        "自分のマシンで動かすなら、セルフホストも。Cloudの料金は適用されません。",
        "Prefer your own machines? You can self-host. Cloud pricing does not apply.",
      )}
    </p>
    <a
      class="text-link"
      href={getRelativeLocaleUrl(locale, "docs/self-hosting/")}
    >
      <span>{t("セルフホストのガイド", "Self-hosting guide")}</span>
      <Icon name="arrow" marketing />
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
